","d":"double"},{"po":121280,"n":"compartment::plasma membrane","v":"2.1226","d":"double"},{"po":121280,"n":"stringdb::imageurl","v":"https://version-12-0.string-db.org//images/Proteinpictures/pdb/3l/3lq9_A.png"},{"po":121280,"n":"tissue::kidney","v":"4.790059","d":"double"},{"po":121280,"n":"baseMean","v":"3036.571797483332","d":"double"},{"po":121280,"n":"@id","v":"stringdb:9606.ENSP00000307305"},{"po":121280,"n":"compartment::endoplasmic reticulum","v":"2.321274","d":"double"},{"po":121280,"n":"stringdb::description","v":"DNA damage-inducible transcript 4 protein; Regulates cell growth, proliferation and survival via inhibition of the activity of the mammalian target of rapamycin complex 1 (mTORC1). Inhibition of mTORC1 is mediated by a pathway that involves DDIT4/REDD1, AKT1, the TSC1-TSC2 complex and the GTPase RHEB. Plays an important role in responses to cellular energy levels and cellular stress, including responses to hypoxia and DNA damage. Regulates p53/TP53-mediated apoptosis in response to DNA damage via its effect on mTORC1 activity. Its role in the response to hypoxia depends on the cell typ [...] "},{"po":121280,"n":"tissue::thyroid gland","v":"2.579005","d":"double"},{"po":121280,"n":"display name","v":"DDIT4"},{"po":121280,"n":"tissue::adrenal gland","v":"2.949408","d":"double"},{"po":121280,"n":"tissue::gall bladder","v":"1.75276","d":"double"},{"po":121280,"n":"log2FoldChange","v":"0.9005804381065553","d":"double"},{"po":121280,"n":"stringdb::sequence","v":"MPSLWDRFSSSSTSSSPSSLPRTPTPDRPPRSAWGSATREEGFDRSTSLESSDCESLDSSNSGFGPEEDTAYLDGVSLPDFELLSDPEDEHLCANLMQLLQESLAQARLGSRRPARLLMPSQLVSQVGKELLRLAYSEPCGLRGALLDVCVEQGKSCHSVGQLALDPSLVPTFQLTLVLRLDSRLWPKIQGLFSSANSPFLPGFSQSLTLSTGFRVIKKKLYSSEQLLIEEC"},{"po":121280,"n":"tissue::intestine","v":"3.265491","d":"double"},{"po":121280,"n":"stringdb::node color","v":"rgb(220,239,117)"},{"po":121280,"n":"stringdb::database identifier","v":"9606.ENSP00000307305"},{"po":121280,"n":"tissue::blood","v":"3.475215","d":"dou