ctrum of important biological functions including proper eye, face, body wall, limb and neural tube development. They also suppress a number of genes including MCAM/MUC18, C/EBP alpha and MYC. AP-2-beta appears to be required for normal face and limb development and for proper terminal differentiation and f [...] "},{"po":121067,"n":"tissue::thyroid gland","v":"1.104475","d":"double"},{"po":121067,"n":"display name","v":"TFAP2B"},{"po":121067,"n":"tissue::adrenal gland","v":"1.506895","d":"double"},{"po":121067,"n":"tissue::gall bladder","v":"0.359564","d":"double"},{"po":121067,"n":"log2FoldChange","v":"-1.952408423370418","d":"double"},{"po":121067,"n":"stringdb::sequence","v":""},{"po":121067,"n":"tissue::intestine","v":"1.426662","d":"double"},{"po":121067,"n":"stringdb::node color","v":"rgb(117,235,239)"},{"po":121067,"n":"stringdb::database identifier","v":"9606.ENSP00000377265"},{"po":121067,"n":"tissue::blood","v":"1.72083","d":"double"},{"po":121067,"n":"tissue::spleen","v":"0.847148","d":"double"},{"po":121058,"n":"padj","v":"0.0402186354599982","d":"double"},{"po":121058,"n":"stringdb::namespace","v":"stringdb"},{"po":121058,"n":"compartment::golgi apparatus","v":"4.384574","d":"double"},{"po":121058,"n":"tissue::urine","v":"2.64509","d":"double"},{"po":121058,"n":"compartment::nucleus","v":"4.652504","d":"double"},{"po":121058,"n":"stringdb::structures","v":["2yvc_F","5jmy_A","AF-P08473"],"d":"list_of_string"},{"po":121058,"n":"tissue::saliva","v":"2.640589","d":"double"},{"po":121058,"n":"stringdb::species","v":"Homo sapiens"},{"po":121058,"n":"compartment::peroxisome","v":"1.531114","d":"double"},{"po":121058,"n":"tissue::liver","v":"4.669882","d":"double"},{"po":121058,"n":"lfcSE","v":"0.4996723580523893","d":"double"},{"po":121058,"n":"compartment::extracellular","v":"4.590689","d":"double"},{"po":121058,"n":"tissue::stomach","v":"3.052142","d":"double"},{"po":121058,"n":"tissue::bone marrow","v":"3.573063","d":"double"},{"po":121058,"n":"compartment