partment::endoplasmic reticulum","v":"1.91293","d":"double"},{"po":120893,"n":"stringdb::description","v":"Runt-related transcription factor 1; Forms the heterodimeric complex core-binding factor (CBF) with CBFB. RUNX members modulate the transcription of their target genes through recognizing the core consensus binding sequence 5'- TGTGGT-3', or very rarely, 5'-TGCGGT-3', within their regulatory regions via their runt domain, while CBFB is a non-DNA-binding regulatory subunit that allosterically enhances the sequence-specific DNA-binding capacity of RUNX. The heterodimers bind to the core site of a number of enhancers and promoters, including murine leukemia virus, polyomavirus enhancer, T [...] "},{"po":120893,"n":"tissue::thyroid gland","v":"2.030114","d":"double"},{"po":120893,"n":"display name","v":"RUNX1"},{"po":120893,"n":"tissue::adrenal gland","v":"1.562177","d":"double"},{"po":120893,"n":"tissue::gall bladder","v":"1.883229","d":"double"},{"po":120893,"n":"stringdb::sequence","v":""},{"po":120893,"n":"tissue::intestine","v":"2.953086","d":"double"},{"po":120893,"n":"stringdb::database identifier","v":"9606.ENSP00000300305"},{"po":120893,"n":"tissue::blood","v":"4.703355","d":"double"},{"po":120893,"n":"tissue::spleen","v":"2.932446","d":"double"},{"po":120890,"n":"padj","v":"0.0076735041657548","d":"double"},{"po":120890,"n":"stringdb::namespace","v":"stringdb"},{"po":120890,"n":"tissue::urine","v":"0.30103","d":"double"},{"po":120890,"n":"compartment::nucleus","v":"4.093103","d":"double"},{"po":120890,"n":"stringdb::structures","v":["AF-Q9H808"],"d":"list_of_string"},{"po":120890,"n":"tissue::saliva","v":"0.467361","d":"double"},{"po":120890,"n":"stringdb::species","v":"Homo sapiens"},{"po":120890,"n":"tissue::liver","v":"1.257447","d":"double"},{"po":120890,"n":"lfcSE","v":"0.3773100525096794","d":"double"},{"po":120890,"n":"compartment::extracellular","v":"0.979904","d":"double"},{"po":120890,"n":"tissue::stomach","v":"0.185637","d":"double"},{"po":1208